  "helpFailed": "You tried the last rep and couldn't finish it.",
  "helpSettingsHint": "You can change the scale in Settings.",
  "helpWarmupTitle": "Warm-up sets",
  "helpWarmupBody": "Lighter sets before the real work, to get your muscles and joints ready. They don't count toward your stats, records or set counts, and aren't rated for effort. With automatic warm-up sets on, the app adds lighter sets before exercises done with a weight and reps, as a share of your first working weight (by default half for 8 reps, then three quarters for 4). You can change the sets, or which exercises get them, in Settings.",
  "helpDropTitle": "Drop sets",
